  F("Pick the correct sentence.",["I would live near the river as a child.","I used to live near the river as a child.","I am used to live near the river as a child.","I use to lived near the river as a child."],"I used to live near the river as a child.","States use used to."),
  B("ঠিক যখন আমি বের হচ্ছিলাম, বৃষ্টি শুরু হলো।",["Just as I was leaving, it started to rain.","Just when I leave, rain is started.","Just as I left, it was starting raining.","Eventually I was leaving, it started rain."],"Just as I was leaving, it started to rain.","Just as + continuous, simple."),
  C("Reacting.","\"I lost my passport in Bangkok.\" \"___ What did you do?\"",["Oh no!","Congratulations!","Cheers!","Well done!"],"Oh no!","Sympathy."),
